# whitelist: an AUR repository holds the PKGBUILD, its metadata, the
# nvchecker config and the small files the PKGBUILD names as local
# sources; makepkg's work (src/, pkg/, the download, the built package,
# logs) is never admitted
*
!.gitignore
!PKGBUILD
!.SRCINFO
!.nvchecker.toml
!*.desktop
!*.svg
!*.install
!*.patch
*/
